SRR4836609	PRJNA352225	SRP092451	SAMN05968112	SRX2320837	Mus musculus	RNAseq_NCCprogenitors_2	RNAseq_NCCprogenitors_2	Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM2371656: RNAseq_NCCprogenitors_2 Mus musculus RNA-Seq	RNA-Seq	TRANSCRIPTOMIC	cDNA	SINGLE	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2500	Embryonic tissues were micro-dissected at E8.5, E10.5 or E11.5 and incubated in trypsin 0.5%/EDTA 1X at 37 °C for 10 minutes and rinsed in DMEM 1X/ FBS 10%. Cranial neural crest cells (CNCCs) were then dissociated with a pipette, filtered and collected by FACS. After sorting, CNCCs were pelleted by centrifugation for 5 minutes, 1000 rpm at 4°C. Total RNA was extracted using PicoPure® Kit (KIT0204 Life Technologies). For sequencing of total RNA, unstranded RNA-Seq libraries were prepared using the ScriptSeq v2 RNA-Seq Library preparation Kit. Three samples with different barcodes were mixed at equimolar ratios per pool. Sequencing was performed on an Illumina HiSeq 2500 machine (50 bp read length, single-end reads) according to Illumina standards.	77208585	3937637835	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR483/009/SRR4836609/SRR4836609.fastq.gz	120b80b6db41b6d678911c839d4fee03	2206511864
